{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261026%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C19%E6%AD%B2%E6%A1%8C%E7%90%83%E5%AE%A4%E5%A5%B3%E8%81%B7%E5%93%A1%E6%B6%89%E8%99%9B%E5%A0%B1%E9%81%AD%E5%BC%B7%E5%A7%A6%E8%A2%AB%E6%8E%A7-%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E6%8A%BC%E5%BE%8C%E8%87%B312.7%E5%86%8D%E8%A8%8A-%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E5%87%86%E4%BB%A5500%E5%85%83%E4%BF%9D%E9%87%8B-819x1024.png\" width=\"819\"/></figure>\n<p><strong>19歲桌球室女職員涉今年8月向警方虛報遭強姦，被控一項「虛報有人犯罪」罪，案件今（26日）於九龍城裁判法院首度提堂，被告暫毋須答辯，案件押後至12月7日再訊。被告准以500元保釋外出，其間不得離港及不得接觸控方證人，每周須到警署報到3次。</strong></p>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>被告楊諾婷（19歲，報稱桌球室職員），被控於2026年8月11日，在黃大仙警署明知地向警長2087及偵緝女警員28254虛報有人犯罪，即虛報一宗強姦案件。</p>\n<p>法院：九龍城裁判法院<br/>被告：楊諾婷<br/>控罪：虛報有人犯罪<br/>案件編號：KCCC3155/2026</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T12:40:59.433873+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":275,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T11:52:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T01:58:10.774195+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T12:38:11.468753+00:00","content_hash":"bdac792d148b83054cd2a113706b2c82c2830e5ddf30c52be5254dfcf5b51de9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HT